     "content_html": "<ol>\n  <li>Testable hypotheses like the gravitational pull on each vehicle while in motion and the average speed of vehicles is 40 mph</li>\n  <li>Non-testable hypotheses like the average number of vehicles passing is 935 per day and carbon emission from each of the moving vehicle</li>\n</ol>\n"
